        "pass after the first (see chosen_biologic), so InfusionContinuation's",
        "repeat visits keep administering the same antibody rather than",
        "re-rolling 60/40 and potentially switching agents mid-therapy."
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "chosen_biologic",
            "operator": "==",
            "value": "lecanemab"
          },
