    "Annual_MCI_Progression_Check": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "remarks": [
        "Task 1.6 containment fix: replaces MCIProgression/RemainMCI's 1-3",
        "year uniform-delay 0.5/0.4/0.1 absorbing chain, which sent ~83% of",
        "MCI patients to AD (matches the audit's '~5/6 progress to AD'",
